{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_060_dps-title\">DPS</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在每个 diffusion 逆时间步，把预训练先验 score 与经 x0 估计反传的测量 likelihood gradient 相加。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Approximates intractable time-dependent measurement likelihood scores ∇_{x_t} log p_t(y|x_t) via backpropagation through the Tweedie posterior mean estimate x̂_0(x_t).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">噪声测量 y、可微前向模型 A 与预训练 diffusion score prior</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Corrupted measurement y, general differentiable forward operator A(·), and pretrained unconditional score network s_θ</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">近似后验样本 x_hat ~ p(x|y)</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Posterior sample x̂ ~ p(x|y) satisfying noisy linear or non-linear measurement constraints</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.6</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.14687\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_060_dps')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_060_dps')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DPS original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e89b537f5e8357d7d9d1.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.6</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_060_dps\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_060_dps')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_060_dps\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">可为线性或非线性、带噪观测</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests corrupted measurement y, general differentiable forward operator a(·), and pretrained unconditional score network s_θ and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"可为线性或非线性、带噪观测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests corrupted measurement y, general differentiable forward operator a(·), and pretrained unconditional score network s_θ and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可为线性或非线性、带噪观测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests corrupted measurement y, general differentiable forward operator a(·), and pretrained unconditional score network s_θ and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可微 forward A；反向传播/伴随 A* 传递 likelihood gradient\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A / A*\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可微 forward A；反向传播/伴随 A* 传递 likelihood gradient</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练 prior 的前向噪声过程，生成从 x0 到 xT 的尺度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Diffusion within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Diffusion 加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"Diffusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Diffusion 加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Diffusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练 prior 的前向噪声过程，生成从 x0 到 xT 的尺度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Diffusion within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从高斯 xT 开始的当前后验采样状态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x_t within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"状态 x_t\" data-node-name-en=\"x_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">状态 x_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从高斯 xT 开始的当前后验采样状态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x_t within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"s_theta(x_t,t) 或等价 epsilon predictor\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prior score within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"先验 score\" data-node-name-en=\"prior score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">先验 score</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prior score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">s_theta(x_t,t) 或等价 epsilon predictor</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prior score within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 x_t 与 score 构造去噪估计 x0_hat(x_t)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x0 within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"x0 估计\" data-node-name-en=\"x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">x0 估计</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 x_t 与 score 构造去噪估计 x0_hat(x_t)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x0 within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对 ||y-A(x0_hat)||^2 求梯度；线性情形含 A*(A x0_hat-y)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Likelihood within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Likelihood 梯度\" data-node-name-en=\"Likelihood\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Likelihood 梯度</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Likelihood</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对 ||y-A(x0_hat)||^2 求梯度；线性情形含 A*(A x0_hat-y)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Likelihood within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"先验 score 与近似 measurement guidance 相加\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs score within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"后验 score\" data-node-name-en=\"score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">后验 score</span><span class=\"lang-en\">score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">先验 score 与近似 measurement guidance 相加</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs score within the core likelihood guided diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"T 个数值步骤反复计算 score、x0_hat 与 DC guidance\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies SDE / ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"逆 SDE / ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"SDE / ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逆 SDE / ODE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SDE / ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">T 个数值步骤反复计算 score、x0_hat 与 DC guidance</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies SDE / ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"t=0 的近似 posterior sample\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces posterior sample x̂ ~ p(x|y) satisfying noisy linear or non-linear measurement constraints via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_060_dps', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">t=0 的近似 posterior sample</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces posterior sample x̂ ~ p(x|y) satisfying noisy linear or non-linear measurement constraints via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DPS Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 先验 score 与测量 likelihood 梯度耦合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Prior Score Coupled with Measurement Likelihood Gradient via Tweedie Denoised Estimate x̂_0</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DPS：核心公式 · 先验 score 与测量 likelihood 梯度耦合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"60\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.079225pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.593377 -69.000129 323.383881 12.079225\" width=\"323.383881pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.597937 0V-.158807C5.032188-.208434 4.96271-.287837 4.843605-1.012393L3.910615-6.63018H3.652554L.774183-1.667471C-.009925-.34739-.10918-.23821-.506196-.158807V0H1.349857V-.158807C.843661-.208434 .764257-.258061 .764257-.506196C.764257-.694779 .794034-.784108 .962766-1.121572L1.528515-2.243145H3.712107L3.910615-.942915C3.920541-.853586 3.930466-.764257 3.930466-.684854C3.930466-.307688 3.79151-.218359 3.156283-.158807V0H5.597937ZM3.66248-2.60046H1.736948L3.225761-5.181069L3.66248-2.60046Z\" id=\"m060_g16-22\"></path><path d=\"M3.017328-1.181125C3.017328-1.568216 2.808894-1.995009 2.342399-2.570684C1.965233-3.037178 1.806426-3.344866 1.806426-3.612853C1.806426-3.950317 2.01486-4.148825 2.36225-4.148825C2.878372-4.148825 3.176134-3.781585 3.2753